-- PermitFlow reference and staff data
-- Depends on 001_schema.sql
--
-- This file seeds only data that a real deployment would configure once: reference
-- tables, the SLA policies, the municipal holiday calendar, and department staff.
-- Sample cases are generated by scripts/seed_cases.py, which drives the process engine
-- so the resulting history is consistent with the rules rather than hand-written.

BEGIN;

